OL,14,     Fpresent Qualifying under the
OL,15,     Flights at Lusail. The titles may
OL,16,     Fhave been decided, but pole will
OL,17,     Fbe vital as Verstappen, Russell
OL,18,     Fand Hamilton fight for second.
